/Title (When a job lot finishes a hold-designated operation \(e.g., Op 30 Heat Treatment Discharge\), the system starts an automated countdown timer on the digital traveler. If a machinist attempts to scan the job into Op 40 Precision Grinding before the hold timer reaches zero, the tablet screen flashes RED, displays "Mandatory Cooling Hold Active \(1 hr 22 min remaining\)," and prevents the machinist from starting the operation. )
