/Title (During active production runs, the system enforces periodic hourly sampling \(e.g., check 3 parts every 50 parts produced, or check every 60 minutes\). When an inspection interval is reached, the tablet emits an audible alert and displays a visual banner: "Periodic Quality Inspection Due." The operator has a 15-minute grace period to log the required sample measurements before the tablet temporarily pauses job timer tracking. )
